+				 * rtw_dequeue_xframe() walks the per-AC hwxmit queues and can
+				 * return frames for DIFFERENT stations, which would build an MPDU
+				 * addressed to one STA carrying another STA's payload. The PCIe
+				 * reference omits this check; harmless at max_num_sta=1, wrong
+				 * in general. */
+				peek = rtw_get_xframe(pxmitpriv, &amsdu_nf);
